# OneOS package set x9u-in-sultra: sha256sum of out/overlays_x9u_in_r68 (scripts/make-overlays.sh on the Find X9 Ultra IN image without debloat, CPH2841IN, 2026-11-03; samcam.tar from scripts/samsung-camera/build-cached.sh; 0.4.39 r53: services_patched.jar with patches/guest_ksu_manager_appid.py, telephony-common_patched.jar (patches/guest_smsc_international.py); samcam.tar with the density in scripts/samsung-camera/fix_bar_width.py (repatch-bar-width.sh), 2026-11-03; 0.4.40: samcam.tar with fix_bar_width.py for narrower screens too; 0.4.40 r55: framework_patched.jar with patches/guest_secims_gba.py (GBA support, sem*State by SIM slot); 0.4.41 r56: samcam.tar with a bar phone read as folded (repatch-compat-folded.sh); 0.4.47 r57: KeKeThemeSpace_patched.apk, the Theme Store without its brand check (the Find N6 global build's APK, byte for byte the same), 2026-11-04; 0.4.48 r58: the same Theme Store reporting OPPO and CPH2765, 2026-11-04; 0.4.55 r59: samcam.tar built from the Galaxy S26 Ultra's own Samsung Camera (S948BXXS4BZIG firmware; scripts/samsung-camera/build-cached.sh with SAMCAM_CACHE and SAMCAM_BAR=1: no fix_bar_width.py, no fix_rear_selfie.py), 2026-11-05; r60 (0.4.56, TEST CHANNEL ONLY): KeKeThemeSpace_patched.apk with patches/theme_store_netlog.py (every OkHttp request and reply in logcat, tag OneOSTheme), 2026-11-05; 0.4.57 r61 from r59 (the 0.4.48 Theme Store again): oplus-services_patched.jar with patches/oplus_resolution_tables.py, samcam.tar with fix_notification_icon.py; 0.4.58 r62: samcam.tar with the patched scamera_sdk_util.jar again, telephony-common + guest_sms_invalid_response.py, oplus-services + oplus_zen_light.py; 0.4.58 r62: telephony-common_patched.jar the same file as the Find N6 set's; 0.4.59 r63: samcam.tar keeps videos on Stop (fix_recorder_track_started.py); 0.4.59 r63: samcam.tar with the gallery fallback (fix_gallery_fallback.py); 0.4.59 r63: samcam.tar with the recording timer and secmedia fallback; 0.4.59 r64: samcam.tar with the camera timer, secmedia queries and gallery fallback; 0.4.59 r65: samcam.tar with the video rotation written after the stop; 0.4.61 r68: samcam.tar with the A phones' settings the S26 Ultra's camera does not know (fix_a_series_modes.py), services_patched.jar with oplus_soundtrigger_no_hal.py), minus tethering_payload.img OneOSWallpapersFoldGrid.apk.
